{"id":"31a340e08cd89ad6","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-levy-target-family-support.md","title":"有限标记项所含的家族历史支持","display":"df-levy-target-family-support — 有限标记项所含的家族历史支持","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-levy-target-family-support","aliases":["56-df-levy-target-family-support"],"display":"df-levy-target-family-support — 有限标记项所含的家族历史支持","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]]","[[56-df-levy-family-development]]"],"source_section":"§8.6 Definition 8.6.57; §9.2 Theorem 9.2.9 proof","source_printed_pages":"408,488","source_ocr_blocks":[429,509],"source_statement_status":"source-proof-component-expanded-locally; original-needed-normalization-route","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-levy-target-family-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-levy-target-family-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-levy-target-family-support — 有限标记项所含的家族历史支持"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a64710f886f4d999\" href=\"?note=a64710f886f4d999\" title=\"56-df-levy-labelled-terms\">56-df-levy-labelled-terms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"866869e983c8003f\" href=\"?note=866869e983c8003f\" title=\"56-df-levy-family-development\">56-df-levy-family-development</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6 Definition 8.6.57; §9.2 Theorem 9.2.9 proof"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"408,488"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>429</span><span>509</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"source-proof-component-expanded-locally; original-needed-normalization-route"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read-and-local-derivation; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a64710f886f4d999\" href=\"?note=a64710f886f4d999\" title=\"56-df-levy-labelled-terms\">56-df-levy-labelled-terms</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_R^L,\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,L_0,C,\\operatorname{PosF},\\operatorname{SubLab}_R\">\\(T_R^L,\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,L_0,C,\\operatorname{PosF},\\operatorname{SubLab}_R\\)</span>；遗忘变量名的模式图 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pat}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{Pat}_L\\)</span> 与模式度论域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_R\">\\(\\mathcal M_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"866869e983c8003f\" href=\"?note=866869e983c8003f\" title=\"56-df-levy-family-development\">56-df-levy-family-development</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\\in T_R^L\">\\(Y\\in T_R^L\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Body}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Body}_R\\)</span> 的定义域仅为下文复杂标签集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_R^L\">\\(\\mathcal C_R^L\\)</span>，以互异构造标签的唯一解析定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(Y)}\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(Y(q)),\\qquad\\mathcal C_R^L\\coloneqq\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\setminus L_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(Y)}\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(Y(q)),\\qquad\\mathcal C_R^L\\coloneqq\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\setminus L_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Body}_R(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\ell\\quad(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\in\\mathcal C_R^L).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Body}_R(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\ell\\quad(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\in\\mathcal C_R^L).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Pat}_L(\\operatorname{Body}_R(c)):c\\in\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\cap\\mathcal C_R^L\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Pat}_L(\\operatorname{Body}_R(c)):c\\in\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\cap\\mathcal C_R^L\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R),\\qquad\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R),\\qquad\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>TSLab取当前项各函数标签的全部递归子标签。每个标签的SubLab有限，当前项函数位有限，故有限并仍有限。复杂标签按构造唯一含有规则λ、带标左项ℓ和右项函数位p，Body抽取带标左项ℓ；标签生成规则保证它来自某条规则。Pat_L再只保留函数位置及其标签，遗忘左变量名，故Pat_L(ℓ)才是原书变量统一孔的模式度。有限标签集合在Pat_L∘Body下的像有限，得到FamSupp有限。</p>\n<p>支持集记录过去创建复杂标签的全部家族，不仅记录当前可收缩红项的度，也不把当前项中相同底层符号当作同一家族。规则身份保存在C中；最后取模式图Pat_L(ℓ)，不会把变量重命名误当成不同模式度；这符合原书degree口径。空变量项的支持为空。对needed证明实际应用的是边扩展后的标记项；即使原正规形是变量，扩展边上的复杂标签仍可保存过去的needed家族。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供Terese (2003)本地DjVu，源文件与规范化提取文本SHA256本轮重核一致。原书9.2.9印刷488页（DjVu物理511页）已实际渲染核对；OCR块从U+001F分段编号，非物理页。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-labelled-terms","status":"resolved","id":"a64710f886f4d999","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-family-development","status":"resolved","id":"866869e983c8003f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-family-development]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-labelled-terms","status":"resolved","id":"a64710f886f4d999","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]] 的 $T_R^L,\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,L_0,C,\\operatorname{PosF},\\operatorname{SubLab}_R$；遗忘变量名的模式图 $\\operatorname{Pat}_L$ 与模式度论域 $\\mathcal M_R$ 见 [[56-df-levy-family-development]]。$Y\\in T_R^L$。$\\operatorname{Body}_R$ 的定义域仅为下文复杂标签集合 $\\mathcal C_R^L$，以互异构造标签的唯一解析定义。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-family-development","status":"resolved","id":"866869e983c8003f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[56-df-levy-labelled-terms]] 的 $T_R^L,\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,L_0,C,\\operatorname{PosF},\\operatorname{SubLab}_R$；遗忘变量名的模式图 $\\operatorname{Pat}_L$ 与模式度论域 $\\mathcal M_R$ 见 [[56-df-levy-family-development]]。$Y\\in T_R^L$。$\\operatorname{Body}_R$ 的定义域仅为下文复杂标签集合 $\\mathcal C_R^L$，以互异构造标签的唯一解析定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T_R^L,\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R,L_0,C,\\operatorname{PosF},\\operatorname{SubLab}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Pat}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_R","display":false},{"tex":"Y\\in T_R^L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Body}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C_R^L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{q\\in\\operatorname{PosF}(Y)}\\operatorname{SubLab}_R(Y(q)),\\qquad\\mathcal C_R^L\\coloneqq\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R\\setminus L_0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Body}_R(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p))\\coloneqq\\ell\\quad(C(\\lambda,\\ell,p)\\in\\mathcal C_R^L).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{Pat}_L(\\operatorname{Body}_R(c)):c\\in\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\cap\\mathcal C_R^L\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TSLab}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R),\\qquad\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R(Y)\\in\\mathcal P_f(\\mathcal M_R).","display":true}],"bytes":2929,"backlinks":[{"id":"465b7969801bc890","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定左线性项重写系统 $R$。标记项集 $T_R^L$、模式度域 $\\mathcal M_R$、具体红项编码集 $\\mathcal E_R$ 及无限家族发展谓词采用 [[56-thm-finite-family-developments]] 及其上游。标记签名 $\\mathcal L\\Sigma_R$、递归子标签集 $\\operatorname{TSLab}_R$ 及家族支持 $\\operatorname{FamSupp}_R$ 采用 [[56-df-levy-target-family-support]]；$\\mathcal P_f(A)$ 是 $A$ 的有限子集族。"},{"id":"ab05114f8f312177","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交TRS，$\\rho_0\\in\\mathcal F_R$，$s=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho_0)$，$z=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho_0)$ 且 $\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,z)$。$M=\\operatorname{LTgt}_R(\\rho_0)$，提升终点无关性见 [[56-lem-levy-normal-form-target]]；$D=\\operatorname{FamSupp}_{R^e}(M)$ 见 [[56-df-levy-target-family-support]]。$\\pi\\in\\{\\xi\\in\\mathcal F_R:\\operatorname{src}(\\xi)=s\\}$。$\\operatorname{InfLift}_R$ 见 [[56-df-infinite-levy-lifting]]；它只在合法无限路径上使用。下文 $\\mathcal A_R(s)$ 是固定源s的合法无限路径集合。$\\operatorname{FinNeeded}_R,\\operatorname{InfNeeded}_R$ 见 [[56-df-needed-reduction-paths]] 及其上游，needed/trace-needed一致性见 [[56-thm-needed-trace-characterization]]；$\\operatorname{FamDev}_{R^e},\\operatorname{InfFamDev}_{R^e}$ 见 [[56-df-levy-family-development]] 的展开系统实例。traced-step度标签桥见 [[56-lem-traced-step-levy-degree]]；可续达同一正规形见 [[56-thm-orthogonal-confluent]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-target-family-support.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a64710f886f4d999","866869e983c8003f"]}